xnu 0419: share the SCM call loop with Venus

Move the GPU static SMC loop to bsd/dev/mondrian_scm.c and export it as
mondrian_scm_call(). The resume and EBUSY retry behavior is unchanged; the
GPU ZAP caller keeps the same function IDs and arguments. Venus PAS uses the
same transport next.

